        "stage": 13,
        "statement": "Waverly Road is threatened."
      },
      {
        "stage": 12,
        "statement": "Structures threatened at Dietrich Environmental Control Facility in Porter. Multiple structures threatened on Lake Vista Court. Wagner Road threatened north of the river. Indian Boundary Road and Brummitt Road may be threatened east of Chesterton."
      },
      {
        "stage": 11,
        "statement": "Mineral Springs Road is threatened. Brickyard Trail inundated near Field Station School in Indiana Dunes National Park. Low-lying parking lots threatend at St. Patrick Elementary School in Chesterton."
      },
      {
        "stage": 10.5,
